@startuml
title C2: Security & Compliance

package "Security" {
  [Secrets Management] --> [GitHub Secrets]
  [Network Security] --> [Yandex VPC]
  [Audit Logs] --> [Log Storage]
  [Threat Detection] --> [SIEM]
  [Compliance Checker] --> [HIPAA/GDPR]
}

[GitHub Actions] --> [Secrets Management]
[Yandex VPC] --> [Firewall Rules]
[VM] --> [Audit Logs]
[SIEM] --> [Alert Team]

note right of [Secrets Management]
  Никогда не в коде
  Используются в CI/CD
end note

note right of [Compliance Checker]
  Проверяет:
  - Шифрование
  - Аудит
  - Доступ
end note

@enduml
